WEBVTT

00:06:56.872 --> 00:07:01.443
And similarly, faces and speech,

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:03.404
turning speech into text,

00:07:03.428 --> 00:07:06.125
learning to talk like you or me,

00:07:06.149 --> 00:07:10.006
even generating natural language,
making up a story,

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.680
AI is getting better and better at it.

00:07:12.704 --> 00:07:16.139
And there are further
advanced applications

00:07:16.163 --> 00:07:19.051
where it's not yet beating people,

00:07:19.075 --> 00:07:24.191
but autonomous vehicles
are now driving millions of miles,

00:07:24.215 --> 00:07:28.942
robotics are able to manipulate
and pick up objects and move around,

00:07:28.966 --> 00:07:34.284
so we're going to see many waves
and new applications coming up over time.